---
import ComponentShowcase from '../components/ComponentShowcase'
import '../styles/global.css'
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta name="description" content="PzHown iOS 27 核心组件文档" />
    <title>PzHown UI · iOS 27 Components</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="components-page">
      <header class="components-page__header">
        <p class="hero-kicker">PZHOWN / CORE COMPONENTS</p>
        <h1>iOS 27 Components</h1>
        <p>这是新组件系统的唯一展示面。旧 aria-nova / shadcn 组件目录、旧状态矩阵和旧主题覆盖层不再参与渲染。</p>
      </header>
      <ComponentShowcase client:load />
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
